# GCDM rhythm

- Answer the user in Russian.
- Follow [PLAN.md](PLAN.md): clean-room rewrite, ~80% AyijeCDM features, no resource/cast bars in v1.
- Never copy code from `../Ayije_CDM` (All Rights Reserved). Feature checklist only.
- Target `## Interface: 110207` until an explicit Midnight bump.
- One module change at a time; after each Skin/Groups change, expect in-game `/reload` verification.
- Apply settings only through `GCDM:Refresh(scope)` (`STYLE`, `LAYOUT`, `GLOW`, `GROUPS`). Options write DB then Refresh.
- Centralize Blizzard viewer hooks in `ViewerRegistry` / `Skin.Apply` — no scattered `hooksecurefunc`.
- No idle `OnUpdate`; stop tickers when inactive.
- Keep `PROJECT_INDEX.md` local (gitignored); update it when structure changes.
- Do not commit secrets, WTF SavedVariables, or zip dumps.
